Place your atlas images in this directory.

Then, update `src/lib/placeholder-images.json` to point to your new image files. For example:

{
  "id": "uc-2-vessel-cord",
  "description": "Cross section of a two-vessel umbilical cord, showing one artery and one vein.",
  "imageUrl": "/images/atlas/uc-2-vessel-cord.jpg",
  "imageHint": "umbilical cord"
}
